\title{MATH 240 syllabus}
\tag{discrete}

\p{The syllabus for [[0020]] can [be found here](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/math240/). Some important highlights:

\ul{
  \li{Your [final grade in the course](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/math240/#grades) is determined by the number of [learning goals](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/math240/#SBG) completed, and the number of [engagement points](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/math240/#engagement) earned.}
  \li{Learning goals can be completed by completing problems on weekly in-class quizzes.}
  \li{Engagement points are earned by \em{e.g.} attending class, completing homework assignments, and attending office hours.}
  \li{Homework is graded only for completion/effort on a credit/no credit basis.}
}

}
